{"author":{"id":"2462ded6f56967dde059994c39a506c79e39e5dfd10c5a07f07a23a5652a8353"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774367487,"nonce":"MAL50kreJIP22gzap8Ud2Iybfqo=","title":"Make REVIEW.md upgradeable via nightshift upgrade","message":"Currently `nightshift upgrade` only handles WORKFLOW.md (compares against `templates/WORKFLOW.md`). REVIEW.md is per-project with no canonical template or upgrade path, so fixes to the review prompt (like the Boundaries section from 4de9c11) must be manually applied to every project.\n\nFix:\n1. Create `templates/REVIEW.md` as the canonical review template (copy from current REVIEW.md in agent-worker root)\n2. Add `template_version` to REVIEW.md YAML front matter\n3. Extend `nightshift upgrade` to also diff and patch REVIEW.md against the canonical template\n4. Extend `nightshift init` to scaffold REVIEW.md from the canonical template (if review config is present in WORKFLOW.md)\n5. `core/upgrade.py` already has the prompt-section diffing logic — reuse it for REVIEW.md\n\nThe upgrade should work the same way as WORKFLOW.md: only the prompt section is diffed/patched, YAML config is never touched.","files":null}]}